    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABRYs67g",
      "title": "validation: add op-contracts/v10.0.0-rc.2 standard versions",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 1424,
      "body": "OPCM 10.0.0 deployed on Sepolia and Mainnet from the [op-contracts/v10.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/releases/tag/op-contracts/v10.0.0-rc.2) tag (b4f9de4eec86e0470e3a6a758c0abb30ae4f08de). op-deployer needs these entries to target the Upgrade 22 release candidate.\n\nAddresses are from the op-deployer bootstrap outputs. Versions were read back from the deployed contracts.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) · session 57a89f91-9030-4e02-937f-95438a53f8be\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-23T21:42:28Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-23T21:57:19Z",
      "additions": 40,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABRmcYiQ",
      "title": "Add kona-client v1.10.0-rc.1 prestates",
      "author": "pauldowman",
      "number": 1425,
      "body": "Publishes the reproducible cannon64 and interop prestates for kona-client v1.10.0-rc.1 (tag `kona-client/v1.10.0-rc.1` at ethereum-optimism/optimism@66dffd81bd). This version carries the Lagoon activation schedule and the OP+Unichain dependency sets needed for Upgrade 22.\n\n| type | hash |\n|---|---|\n| cannon64-kona | `0x039dad0a73ec8d59336fd1ca75f0e479df3ced76a52c1a868712017ce54cc8cf` |\n| cannon64-kona-interop | `0x034589520fac03115a1d2f1dc8ae3632c15593d4b084a6bbb985966f20fed93d` |\n\nThe monorepo's nightly prestate reproducibility check fails until this merges, since it rebuilds every kona-client tag.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-24T16:25:30Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-24T22:50:26Z",
      "additions": 8,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABRUjW8w",
      "title": "ops: bump go-ethereum to 3dee18e7108c and the monorepo to 2ad37990e12c",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 1423,
      "body": "Bumps the `ops` module from go-ethereum v1.17.10 to `3dee18e7108c` and to monorepo `2ad37990e12c`, the commit of ethereum-optimism/optimism#24350 that moved the monorepo to that go-ethereum pin.\n\ngo-ethereum v1.17.10 cannot decode a transaction from JSON if one of its EIP-7702 authorizations has a yParity other than 0 or 1, although the chain allows any byte there. No go-ethereum release contains the fix yet.\n\n`ops` decodes a transaction from JSON in one place, the deployment transaction lookup of the L1 report, so the bug is unlikely to reach it. The bump keeps the module on the pair the monorepo tests together.\n\n🤖 *Co-created with Claude Fable 5.2*\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-23T16:53:20Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 6,
      "deletions": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABRp8OBQ",
      "title": "validation: replace op-contracts/v10.0.0-rc.2 with the final v10.0.0 entries",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 1427,
      "body": "Renames the `op-contracts/v10.0.0-rc.2` entries from #1424 to the final `op-contracts/v10.0.0`. The final tag is on the same commit as rc.2 (b4f9de4eec86e0470e3a6a758c0abb30ae4f08de), so the contracts were not redeployed and the addresses and versions are unchanged. No op-deployer release targets rc.2, so nothing needs the rc entry.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code) · session 57a89f91-9030-4e02-937f-95438a53f8be\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-24T20:28:34Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-24T20:47:39Z",
      "additions": 6,
      "deletions": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABRn5fVQ",
      "title": "Add kona-sp1 v1.0.0-rc.1 prestate",
      "author": "pauldowman",
      "number": 1426,
      "body": "Registers the kona-sp1-program v1.0.0-rc.1 super-aggregation vkey (tag `kona-sp1-program/v1.0.0-rc.1` at ethereum-optimism/optimism@66dffd81bd), which carries the Lagoon activation schedule and the OP+Unichain dependency sets.\n\n| program | vkey |\n|---|---|\n| super-aggregation | `0x0073def5ff73ea4fa3adb828fa0839943e1fbf439e669779c66dcea387d71562` |\n| super-range | `0x0062247d38e678d1c568ba435fa323c83b03d84540c56c1f68041ed22d5cc6ef` |\n| log-commitment | `0x00ed173ceb9dab14f2668f3cabcfb8d51ddf6f757db048ae008a00dbafec8aca` |\n\nThe ELFs are published by CI under https://storage.googleapis.com/oplabs-network-data/proofs/kona/sp1/ (`<vkey>.log.bin.gz`, `.range.bin.gz`, `.agg.bin.gz`). Once merged, the monorepo's nightly reproducibility check rebuilds this version and compares the super-aggregation vkey.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-24T18:05:20Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-24T22:51:21Z",
